millions of years must have made you senile.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.862
And you, Michael...

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:31.865
| helped you out so much, and
you turned on me in an instant.

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:35.702
That's why you'll never
rise above number two.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.204
Well, I don't give a damn anymore.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.956
