00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:45.308
You're an angel, right?

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:47.477
Wait, could you be Lucifer-sama?

00:03:47.686 --> 00:03:48.895
| knew it!

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:50.313
Ranked number one among angels.

00:03:50.522 --> 00:03:51.815
