so popular down in Hell.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.627
You know, it's pretty cold down here.

00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:16.757
This is the lowest level of Hell, Cocytus,
where anything and everything freezes.

00:04:16.965 --> 00:04:19.259
