00:16:48.591 --> 00:16:50.676
Belial-ojousama.

00:16:50.885 --> 00:16:52.678
Who are you?

00:16:52.887 --> 00:16:54.931
Gnosis.

00:16:55.139 --> 00:17:00.269
It is pitiful to see you like that.
Please use my body.

00:17:00.478 --> 00:17:03.606
| will protect you with all I am.

00:17:03.814 --> 00:17:04.815
Very well.

00:17:14.116 --> 00:17:14.992
Oh?

00:17:15.201 --> 00:17:19.080
Fallen angel, take my special attack!

00:17:29.382 --> 00:17:30.466
She ran away.

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:36.472
In the name of Belial, the leader,
| command all Seven Mortal Sins.

00:17:36.681 --> 00:17:38.683
Capture the fallen angel, Lucifer!

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:41.185
| don't care how much you hurt her.

00:17:43.479 --> 00:17:45.273
I'm first.

00:17:51.362 --> 00:17:52.738
I'm not letting you get away!

00:17:53.823 --> 00:17:54.991
Satan!

00:17:55.199 --> 00:17:56.284
Prepare yourself!

00:17:57.952 --> 00:17:59.620
There we go!

00:18:06.085 --> 00:18:09.171
Give me a turn, too.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.048
Sorry.

00:18:13.593 --> 00:18:16.846
Hey, Asmo, that's dirty.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:25.271
| am Asmodeus of Lust.

00:18:25.479 --> 00:18:28.858
| wanted to try an angel once.

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:32.987
| can't wait to see how you act.

00:18:33.195 --> 00:18:36.032
Asmodeus, don't do anything unnecessary!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:40.786
Onee-sama is always doing
pervy stuff with Levi!

00:18:40.995 --> 00:18:43.372
What are you going on about?!

00:18:43.581 --> 00:18:45.458
You dummies!

00:18:48.419 --> 00:18:51.756
Now it's time to give that
rotten angel that doesn't know

00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:55.635
her place the full course
of the true pains of Hell.

00:18:56.636 --> 00:19:01.766
| have so many regrets.

00:19:01.974 --> 00:19:07.938
| have to get tortured by trash like you just
because I have the wings of an angel.

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:09.565
Very well.

00:19:09.774 --> 00:19:12.735
This is going to hurt, so prepare yourself.

00:19:21.327 --> 00:19:23.996
You guys give it a try.

00:19:24.205 --> 00:19:25.790
It's quite fun.

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:28.292
| don't know if I feel
very motivated anymore.

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:29.669
This is scary.

00:19:29.877 --> 00:19:32.630
That's quite the twisted
personality you have there.

00:19:32.838 --> 00:19:34.382
I'm fine with fighting,

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:38.052
but I don't like just tormenting someone.

00:19:39.053 --> 00:19:41.305
Now there's only one left.

00:19:41.514 --> 00:19:43.224
You can cry if you want.

00:19:43.432 --> 00:19:45.017
You've got to be kidding...

00:19:45.226 --> 00:19:48.604
Don't think things are going
to get easier on you.

00:19:48.813 --> 00:19:52.024
You will suffer and writhe in pain.

00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:54.026
Let's get going.

00:19:54.235 --> 00:19:55.069
Sure.

00:19:55.277 --> 00:19:56.737
Yeah.

00:19:56.946 --> 00:19:59.865
It looks like things are
about to get interesting.

00:20:02.618 --> 00:20:04.787
Wait, Mortal Sins!

00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:16.799
| thank you for cutting my
restraints to God, Belial.

00:20:17.007 --> 00:20:19.051
My name is Lucifer,

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:23.639
the one who goes against God, the demon
lord burdened with the sin of pride!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.352
The lid to the underworld has opened.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.855
Onee-sama!

00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:32.148
She's being cast out.

00:20:32.356 --> 00:20:34.400
She's probably heading to Earth.

00:20:34.608 --> 00:20:35.484
How foolish.

00:20:35.693 --> 00:20:38.654
I'm sure that angel has learned her place.

00:20:38.863 --> 00:20:40.656
I'm not so sure about that.

00:20:40.865 --> 00:20:44.118
The symbol of a demon lord,
the horns, grew on her head.

00:20:44.326 --> 00:20:45.494
Also...

00:20:48.622 --> 00:20:50.708
Damn you, Lucifer!

00:20:50.916 --> 00:20:52.960
| won't forgive you for this!

00:20:53.961 --> 00:20:56.046
> My existence
breaks all the rules )

00:20:56.255 --> 00:20:58.382
> I don't want to see anything that's pretty J

00:20:58.591 --> 00:21:00.384
> You know most of this
place is all screwed up J

00:21:00.593 --> 00:21:03.888
Maria, I'm going to head out.

00:21:04.096 --> 00:21:05.389
Sure.

00:21:05.598 --> 00:21:09.018
See you again next semester.

00:21:09.226 --> 00:21:10.227
Yeah.

00:21:25.743 --> 00:21:28.496
Onee-sama! Onee-sama!

00:21:35.169 --> 00:21:36.712
The angel...

00:21:36.921 --> 00:21:38.589
You're...

00:21:40.424 --> 00:21:42.384
Huh? Who are you?

00:21:44.011 --> 00:21:45.763
Totsuka Maria...

00:21:46.931 --> 00:21:49.016
I'm not an angel.

00:21:55.564 --> 00:21:57.024
Huh?

00:21:57.233 --> 00:21:58.943
|I am a demon lord.

00:21:59.151 --> 00:22:00.194
Demon Lord Lucifer!

00:22:00.194 --> 00:22:01.070
"The Proud Fallen Angel"
Demon Lord Lucifer!

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:02.947
"The Proud Fallen Angel"

00:22:14.834 --> 00:22:23.008
Welcome to our diabolic paradise!

00:22:24.301 --> 00:22:29.473
Pride and greed and envy are all in you

00:22:29.682 --> 00:22:31.392
Look at yourself

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:37.773
Sloth and wrath and lust and gluttony

00:22:37.982 --> 00:22:39.942
You're made from them

